  m_text: Ignite a physically coupled booster trailer with ACTION. Steer pitch/yaw
    with your movement controls; hold ACTION to burn fuel, release then press again
    after three seconds to separate the booster. After separation, hold ACTION for
    the air brake/parachute. Land on your illuminated pad for a controlled-landing
    bonus. Fuel, altitude, distance and impact are measured from the real rig. Detached
    boosters remain physical objects. Each participant has an independent launch
    lane.
